  "notes": "USAGE:\n{譲渡|じょうと} is a formal, legal term. It is used for official transfers of property, rights, shares, or assets. In casual speech, {譲|ゆず}る (to hand over, to yield) is preferred.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {譲渡|じょうと}{所得|しょとく} (capital gains from transfer)\n- {譲渡|じょうと}{契約|けいやく} (transfer agreement)\n- {株式|かぶしき}{譲渡|じょうと} (share transfer)\n- {権利|けんり}の{譲渡|じょうと} (assignment of rights)\n- {譲渡|じょうと}{益|えき} (transfer profit)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {譲|ゆず}る: to hand over, to yield (general, less formal)\n- {移転|いてん}: transfer, relocation (broader usage)",
